{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UiCPJQB6Yz7LRL5n7SUoCP","type":"tool_result","content":"1038\t## 7. Lift and lower\n1039\t\n1040\t### 7.1 Lift\n1041\t\n1042\t**DECIDED** (draft §9, UCF §7.8): refuse unless quiescent; refuse the\n1043\tholds (`unliftable-hold`, `handoff.cljc:588`) as `:yin.k/non-portable\n1044\t:reason-mismatch`; classify kind; run the **dependency closure over the\n1045\t`\"v4\"` vectors**, which needs the phase-5 scanners\n1046\t(`scan/requirements`, `scan/free-names`, `scan/free-occurrences` over the\n1047\t§2.3 table: the current `completion/code-facts` reads stack-table\n1048\tpositions and cannot be used), and refuse `:yin.k/unsatisfied` unless\n1049\t`:complete`, `:yin.k/trees` included; number cursor cells (draft §6); walk\n1050\twaits, parked records, the store slice, module stores, the free\n1051\tenvironment (from the kernel's `:free-env` field or the lift's explicit\n1052\t`:free-env` argument, §6.3, never from a current `E`), the result,\n1053\tinstall children; run `frame/defect` over every\n1054\tframe; emit rows and the census. A de Bruijn source walks the frames\n1055\t`layout/lift-act`/`lift-tail` reconstruct.\n1056\t\n1057\t### 7.2 Lower\n1058\t\n1059\t**DECIDED** (draft §8 in order; §3.3): gate, structure, graph, hashes,\n1060\tcanonical form, canonical numbering, **frames**, pending and operations,\n1061\tdependency closure (`requires`/`code` agree with the census;\n1062\t`:yin.k/trees` complete per §6.1), custody, composition, restore. Restore\n1063\tbuilds the receiving kernel's state: semantic-register: `code` through\n1064\t`load-vector`/`attach-image` under `code/contract`, the free environment\n1065\tas base `:env`, each `:wait` to an engine entry (payload plus the\n1066\tpending's engine fields, `lower-frame!`'s shapes, `handoff.cljc:3182-3246`,\n1067\t`:deliver` carried), parked records into `:parked`, the result into\n1068\t`:value`; de Bruijn: derive and attach the image for each A, set\n1069\t`:free-env`, and `layout/lower-act`/`lower-tail` each frame (the stack\n1070\tlane's `tail` needs 6c-pre). Restoration delivers nothing, runs nothing,\n1071\tmints nothing.\n1072\t\n1073\t---\n1074\t\n1075\t## 8. Slices, gates, entry conditions"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"195d2023-8c95-40ce-b61e-3288e37d4c05","uuid":"0176a824-7c2a-4e6c-88f8-6158c00eb45f","timestamp":"2026-10-12T16:36:04.696Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p6b/docs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md","content":"## 7. Lift and lower\n\n### 7.1 Lift\n\n**DECIDED** (draft §9, UCF §7.8): refuse unless quiescent; refuse the\nholds (`unliftable-hold`, `handoff.cljc:588`) as `:yin.k/non-portable\n:reason-mismatch`; classify kind; run the **dependency closure over the\n`\"v4\"` vectors**, which needs the phase-5 scanners\n(`scan/requirements`, `scan/free-names`, `scan/free-occurrences` over the\n§2.3 table: the current `completion/code-facts` reads stack-table\npositions and cannot be used), and refuse `:yin.k/unsatisfied` unless\n`:complete`, `:yin.k/trees` included; number cursor cells (draft §6); walk\nwaits, parked records, the store slice, module stores, the free\nenvironment (from the kernel's `:free-env` field or the lift's explicit\n`:free-env` argument, §6.3, never from a current `E`), the result,\ninstall children; run `frame/defect` over every\nframe; emit rows and the census. A de Bruijn source walks the frames\n`layout/lift-act`/`lift-tail` reconstruct.\n\n### 7.2 Lower\n\n**DECIDED** (draft §8 in order; §3.3): gate, structure, graph, hashes,\ncanonical form, canonical numbering, **frames**, pending and operations,\ndependency closure (`requires`/`code` agree with the census;\n`:yin.k/trees` complete per §6.1), custody, composition, restore. Restore\nbuilds the receiving kernel's state: semantic-register: `code` through\n`load-vector`/`attach-image` under `code/contract`, the free environment\nas base `:env`, each `:wait` to an engine entry (payload plus the\npending's engine fields, `lower-frame!`'s shapes, `handoff.cljc:3182-3246`,\n`:deliver` carried), parked records into `:parked`, the result into\n`:value`; de Bruijn: derive and attach the image for each A, set\n`:free-env`, and `layout/lower-act`/`lower-tail` each frame (the stack\nlane's `tail` needs 6c-pre). Restoration delivers nothing, runs nothing,\nmints nothing.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Slices, gates, entry conditions","numLines":38,"startLine":1038,"totalLines":1762}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UiCPJQB6Yz7LRL5n7SUoCP","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
