{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K8NQH8gYRpS5bbzNWRasEz","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t(ns yin.vm.ucf.rows\n2\t  \"Version-3 row codec. Pure row construction, graph decoding and\n3\t   discovery-order cursor-cell numbering (design note §1), then full task\n4\t   transport for the semantic-register kernel (continuation design §7):\n5\t   lift-task walks a quiescent machine into an abstract task and emits it;\n6\t   lower-task decodes, checks and restores one into a fresh receiver.\n7\t   An abstract row is {:kind keyword :slots vector}. Structural references\n8\t   contain abstract rows; values use [:lit d], [:row abstract-row], [:cursor-cell id].\n9\t   A task's :cursor-cells row holds alternating source identities and :cursor-cell-body\n10\t   rows. Install children are separate tasks with separate cursor-cell scopes.\n11\t\n12\t   The census is ordered numerically by n (draft §3, \\\"sorted by n\\\"), so\n13\t   :yin.k/cc-10 follows :yin.k/cc-9; its keys must spell cc-N with no leading\n14\t   zero, else :slot-kind.\n15\t\n16\t   Default value markers are plain maps {:yin.k/row abstract-row} and\n17\t   {:yin.k/cursor-cell keyword}. A guest map whose sole key is :yin.k/row or\n18\t   :yin.k/cursor-cell collides with them and is not portable: on encode and decode\n19\t   every literal of that shape is refused :yin.k/non-portable. Explicit\n20\t   markers use the caller value encoder.\"\n21\t  (:require [dao.jing :as jing]\n22\t            [dao.jing.cbor :as cbor]\n23\t            [dao.stream.apply :as apply2]\n24\t            [yin.vm :as vm]\n25\t            [yin.vm.engine :as engine]\n26\t            [yin.vm.module :as module]\n27\t            [yin.vm.values :as values]\n28\t            [yin.vm.semantic-register.code :as code]\n29\t            [yin.vm.semantic-register.frame :as frame]\n30\t            [yin.vm.semantic-register.scan :as scan]\n31\t            [yin.vm.ucf.remote :as remote]))\n32\t\n33\t\n34\t(def profile {:yin.code/contract \"v4\" :yin.k/version 1})\n35\t\n36\t\n37\t(def pending-table\n38\t  {:next [:C]\n39\t   :put [[:ref :stream] :V :D]\n40\t   :ffi [:C :D :D]\n41\t   :ffi-request [:D :V [:ref :stream] [:ref :stream] :C :D]\n42\t   :link-request [:D :S [:ref :stream] [:ref :stream] :C :D :D]\n43\t   :link-response [:D :S [:ref :stream] [:ref :stream] :C]\n44\t   :install [:S]})\n45\t\n46\t\n47\t(def row-table\n48\t  \"Slot descriptors, excluding id and kind. :repeat/:pairs are variadic;\n49\t   :refs is an ordered vector of structural references. :pending is\n50\t   discriminated by pending-table. Nothing in this table is executable.\"\n51\t  {:vec [:repeat :V] :list [:repeat :V] :set [:repeat :V]\n52\t   :map [:pairs :V :V] :bindings [:pairs :S :V] :store [:pairs :D :V]\n53\t   :env [[:ref :bindings] :optional-D]\n54\t   :closure [:A :N :syms [:ref :bindings] :optional-D]\n55\t   :prim [:S] :stream [:D :D] :reified [[:ref :act]] :parked-ref [:D]\n56\t   :act [:A :N [:ref :env] [:ref :window] [:ref :k] :N]\n57\t   :tail [:A :N [:ref :k]]\n58\t   :window [:pairs :N :V] :k [:repeat [:ref :kframe]]\n59\t   :kframe [:A :N [:ref :env] [:ref :window] :N]\n60\t   :wait [[:ref :act :tail] [:ref :pending]] :pending :pending\n61\t   :module-store [:D [:ref :store]]\n62\t   :parked-table [:pairs :D [:ref :act :tail]]\n63\t   :install [:S :D :D :D [:ref :task]]\n64\t   :cursor-cells [:pairs :C [:ref :cursor-cell-body]] :cursor-cell-body [[:ref :stream] :D]\n65\t   :task [:N :D :D :D :N [:ref :bindings] [:ref :store]\n66\t          [:refs :module-store] [:ref :parked-table] [:ref :cursor-cells]\n67\t          :D :D [:refs :install] [:refs :wait] :optional-D :optional-V :optional-D]})\n68\t\n69\t\n70\t(defn node"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"195d2023-8c95-40ce-b61e-3288e37d4c05","uuid":"c7c5230b-885b-45d5-90f2-b3236e47eea8","timestamp":"2026-10-12T16:36:52.578Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p6b/src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/rows.cljc","content":"(ns yin.vm.ucf.rows\n  \"Version-3 row codec. Pure row construction, graph decoding and\n   discovery-order cursor-cell numbering (design note §1), then full task\n   transport for the semantic-register kernel (continuation design §7):\n   lift-task walks a quiescent machine into an abstract task and emits it;\n   lower-task decodes, checks and restores one into a fresh receiver.\n   An abstract row is {:kind keyword :slots vector}. Structural references\n   contain abstract rows; values use [:lit d], [:row abstract-row], [:cursor-cell id].\n   A task's :cursor-cells row holds alternating source identities and :cursor-cell-body\n   rows. Install children are separate tasks with separate cursor-cell scopes.\n\n   The census is ordered numerically by n (draft §3, \\\"sorted by n\\\"), so\n   :yin.k/cc-10 follows :yin.k/cc-9; its keys must spell cc-N with no leading\n   zero, else :slot-kind.\n\n   Default value markers are plain maps {:yin.k/row abstract-row} and\n   {:yin.k/cursor-cell keyword}. A guest map whose sole key is :yin.k/row or\n   :yin.k/cursor-cell collides with them and is not portable: on encode and decode\n   every literal of that shape is refused :yin.k/non-portable. Explicit\n   markers use the caller value encoder.\"\n  (:require [dao.jing :as jing]\n            [dao.jing.cbor :as cbor]\n            [dao.stream.apply :as apply2]\n            [yin.vm :as vm]\n            [yin.vm.engine :as engine]\n            [yin.vm.module :as module]\n            [yin.vm.values :as values]\n            [yin.vm.semantic-register.code :as code]\n            [yin.vm.semantic-register.frame :as frame]\n            [yin.vm.semantic-register.scan :as scan]\n            [yin.vm.ucf.remote :as remote]))\n\n\n(def profile {:yin.code/contract \"v4\" :yin.k/version 1})\n\n\n(def pending-table\n  {:next [:C]\n   :put [[:ref :stream] :V :D]\n   :ffi [:C :D :D]\n   :ffi-request [:D :V [:ref :stream] [:ref :stream] :C :D]\n   :link-request [:D :S [:ref :stream] [:ref :stream] :C :D :D]\n   :link-response [:D :S [:ref :stream] [:ref :stream] :C]\n   :install [:S]})\n\n\n(def row-table\n  \"Slot descriptors, excluding id and kind. :repeat/:pairs are variadic;\n   :refs is an ordered vector of structural references. :pending is\n   discriminated by pending-table. Nothing in this table is executable.\"\n  {:vec [:repeat :V] :list [:repeat :V] :set [:repeat :V]\n   :map [:pairs :V :V] :bindings [:pairs :S :V] :store [:pairs :D :V]\n   :env [[:ref :bindings] :optional-D]\n   :closure [:A :N :syms [:ref :bindings] :optional-D]\n   :prim [:S] :stream [:D :D] :reified [[:ref :act]] :parked-ref [:D]\n   :act [:A :N [:ref :env] [:ref :window] [:ref :k] :N]\n   :tail [:A :N [:ref :k]]\n   :window [:pairs :N :V] :k [:repeat [:ref :kframe]]\n   :kframe [:A :N [:ref :env] [:ref :window] :N]\n   :wait [[:ref :act :tail] [:ref :pending]] :pending :pending\n   :module-store [:D [:ref :store]]\n   :parked-table [:pairs :D [:ref :act :tail]]\n   :install [:S :D :D :D [:ref :task]]\n   :cursor-cells [:pairs :C [:ref :cursor-cell-body]] :cursor-cell-body [[:ref :stream] :D]\n   :task [:N :D :D :D :N [:ref :bindings] [:ref :store]\n          [:refs :module-store] [:ref :parked-table] [:ref :cursor-cells]\n          :D :D [:refs :install] [:refs :wait] :optional-D :optional-V :optional-D]})\n\n\n(defn node","numLines":70,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1728}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01K8NQH8gYRpS5bbzNWRasEz","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
